32482&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Sections_21_d3e81d5c-e8b7-4d43-9779-c47209e1c010.png?v=1745332482&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Sections_21_d3e81d5c-e8b7-4d43-9779-c47209e1c010.png?v=1745332482&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.2686062246278755" width="1875" height="1478" sizes="75vw" data-action="url" data-href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-lmUbDS jhRUAf pf-61_" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-kUdmUV iejJTZ pf-62_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">My daughter did a bit of research and&nbsp;told me that <strong><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick® Omni</a></strong> <strong>even</strong>&nbsp;<strong>makes continuous backups a breeze.</strong><br><br>All I have to do is plug it into my phone, and <strong>it does the hard work&nbsp;for me</strong>, picking up right where my last backup left off. It's really&nbsp;that simple!</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cyRdfs qmQNK pf-64_ pf-heading-1-h3">How Does It Work?</h3><p class="sc-kUdmUV iejJTZ pf-66_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">As I've mentioned before, the best part about&nbsp;<strong>ThePhotoStick® Omni</strong> is how easy it really is to use! <br><br><strong>Anyone can use it to back up their files </strong>–&nbsp;no technical knowledge needed.<strong><br></strong><br><strong>Just follow these 3 easy steps:<br></strong><br><b>STEP 1:</b>&nbsp;Download and open ThePhotoStick® Omni app on your phone.<br><br><b>STEP 2:</b>&nbsp;Plug the device into your phone using the specialized adapter.<br><br><b>STEP 3:</b>&nbsp;Then, click the button on the app that says "Back Up Files Now!" – and that's it.<br><br><strong><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick® Omni</a> scans your entire device and bac